 'js-adv-math':`def solve(arr):\n    if not arr: return 0\n    best = run = 1\n    for i in range(1, len(arr)):\n        if arr[i] > arr[i-1]: run += 1\n        else: run = 1\n        best = max(best, run)\n    return best`
